* ============================================================================
* 15_attention_main_regression.do — Table 2 M1→M6 progressive (bank_fintech_attention / P2)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: B_route_master_plan_v2 §5.5.2 + §B.2 P2 spec
*
*   DV   = {{MAIN_DV}}    (default ln_fintech_investment per spec.outcome.primary)
*   X    = {{MAIN_TREAT}} (default attention_index_full per spec.treatment.primary)
*   理论锚点 (Theory anchor): Hassan-Hollander-van Lent-Tahoun 2019 QJE 134(4) —
*                  firm-level 政治风险暴露测度 (political risk exposure, intensity DiD)。
*
* M1: 裸回归 (仅 treatment, 无控制无 FE)
* M2: + bank FE (银行固定效应)
* M3: + bank FE + year FE (银行+年份双固定效应)
* M4: + 标准银行层面控制变量
* M5: + 宏观控制 (gdp_growth / m2_growth)
* M6: + treatment × DCEP-post 交互 (staggered 央行数字货币试点; 见下方 reconcile 注)
*
* 识别策略 (面板设计 reconcile, 审计 2026-06-14 ID-1/ID-3/ID-7):
*   基线 = 双向固定效应 (TWFE) 面板回归 (bank FE + year FE) via reghdfe (M1-M6)。
*   M6 = treatment × DCEP 试点 post 交互 (staggered 央行数字货币试点; dcep_post 来自
*        iv_did.merge_policy_shocks 已物化列, 替换此前无管道生产者的 post_E1)。
*   M7 = DCEP 试点错时 DiD 辅助 (Callaway-Sant'Anna 2021 JoE csdid), **正交政策冲击稳健性**
*        — ⚠ 非本文注意力主设计 (本文 baseline = cross_sectional_intensity_did; staggered
*        csdid 系 spec 的 legacy_label 承诺)。处理 cohort = DCEP 试点 (gvar=dcep_treat_year),
*        估计 DCEP 政策对 outcome 的 ATT; 注意力变量 **不进** csdid 协变量 (避免把利益渠道
*        当 bad-control), 仅 $controls 作协变量。数据驱动启用: distinct year >=3 且 csdid 已
*        安装时运行, 消费 iv_did 物化的 dcep_treat_year / dcep_rel_year; 控制组 notyet
*        (保守默认, 含 never-treated, 无 no-anticipation 偏倚)。T=2 盘面 distinct year=2 <3
*        → 优雅跳过; T>=3 自动激活 (不再硬编码永久禁用)。
*   HQ-based 处理分配披露 (iv_did.py:633): soe/joint 总部≠业务暴露, robustness 见 17_。
*   IV: leave-one-out 同业 attention (19_attention_iv_first_stage + 22_tableA3_bartik_iv)。
* 白话: 基线用普通双向固定效应回归; 另跑一个"分期 DiD"作稳健性, 它至少要三年数据 —
*       数据够了 (跑全量语料后) 自动开, 现在两年数据自动跳过, 不再写死永久禁用。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* M1: 裸回归
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}}, noabsorb vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M1

* M2: + bank FE (银行固定效应)
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}}, ///
    absorb(bank_id) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M2

* M3: + bank FE + year FE (银行内、年份内变异的基准设定)
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}}, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M3

* M4: + 银行层面控制变量
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M4

* M5: + 宏观控制
capture confirm variable gdp_growth m2_growth
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls gdp_growth m2_growth, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo M5
}
else {
    display "  [INFO] gdp_growth / m2_growth 不存在; M5 复用 M4 规格"
    eststo M5: reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
}

* M6: + treatment × DCEP-post 交互 (staggered 央行数字货币试点)
* ID-3 修复 (审计 2026-06-14): 原 M6 用 post_E1 — 全管道无生产者 → capture confirm
* 永久静默跳过。改用 iv_did.merge_policy_shocks 已物化的 dcep_post (真错时冲击)。
* 更细的 wave × treatment 交互检验见 17_attention_heterogeneity.do。
capture confirm variable dcep_post
if !_rc {
    qui summarize dcep_post
    if r(sd) > 0 & r(sd) < . {
        gen treat_x_dcep = {{MAIN_TREAT}} * dcep_post
        reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} dcep_post treat_x_dcep $controls, ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
        eststo M6
    }
    else {
        display "  [INFO] dcep_post 无组内变异 (T=2 盘面处理年份>面板末年); M6 跳过 — 待 T>=3 生产面板自动激活"
    }
}
else {
    display "  [INFO] dcep_post 不存在 (run iv_did.merge_policy_shocks via runner); M6 跳过"
}

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — M6 依赖 post_E1 (无管道
* 生产者), 守卫跳过后旧版硬点名 M6 → r(111) 丢整表且 master 链中止; 改为仅引用实际
* 已存储估计, mtitle 同步删列防错位。
* 白话: 出表时只点名实际估计成功的模型, 防止某一列缺席导致整张表报错丢失。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6
local cand_titles `""M1 bare" "M2 +bankFE" "M3 +yearFE" "M4 +ctrl" "M5 +macro" "M6 +DCEP×tr""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
esttab `models' using "$tables_dir/table2_main.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Main Results --- bank_fintech_attention (P2)") ///
    mtitles(`mtitles') ///
    addnotes("Baseline: two-way fixed-effects (TWFE) panel regression; bank and year FE; SE clustered at {{CLUSTER_VAR}}." ///
             "M6 = treatment x DCEP-pilot post (staggered shock; dcep_post from iv_did.merge_policy_shocks, replaces the non-produced post_E1)." ///
             "M7 = DCEP-pilot staggered DiD auxiliary (Callaway-Sant'Anna 2021 csdid, gvar=dcep_treat_year, control=notyet, attention NOT a covariate) — an orthogonal policy-shock robustness, NOT the paper's attention identification (baseline=cross_sectional_intensity_did); runs when distinct years>=3 & csdid installed, skipped on T=2." ///
             "IV first stage in 19_attention_iv_first_stage.do; Bartik fallback in 22_tableA3_bartik_iv.")

* fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel — papers/bank_fintech_attention/
* tables.py:build_table2_main 经 read_paper_esttab('bank_fintech_attention',
* 'table2_main.csv') 消费; estout+delimiter(",") 防 esttab csv 的 ="..." Excel 包裹
* (或 plain 丢 SE 括号) 破坏 stata_postprocess.parse_esttab_csv 解析。
estout `models' using "$tables_dir/table2_main.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
    starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) mlabels(`mtitles')

display "[OK] Table 2 (M1-M6) → $tables_dir/table2_main.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"

* ============================================================================
* M7 (DCEP 试点错时 DiD 辅助稳健性, 审计 2026-06-14 ID-1/ID-7 + 核验修订):
*   Callaway-Sant'Anna (2021 JoE) csdid + event-study, 兑现 spec legacy_label
*   (staggered_did_callaway_santanna) 承诺。⚠ 这是 **正交政策冲击** 稳健性 (DCEP 央行数字
*   货币试点错时铺开), **非** 本文注意力主设计 (本文 baseline = cross_sectional_intensity_did;
*   exogenous_shocks.yaml 自述 E1-E5b 系同步强度 DiD 非错时)。处理 cohort = dcep_treat_year
*   (DCEP 政策), csdid 估计 DCEP 政策对 outcome 的 ATT; 注意力变量 **不进** csdid 协变量
*   (它是利益渠道, 进协变量会 bad-control / over-condition), 仅 $controls。
*   数据驱动门控: distinct year >=3 且 csdid 已安装且存在处理组时运行; T=2 盘面优雅跳过。
*   控制组 = notyet (not-yet-treated; 保守默认, 含 never-treated, 无 no-anticipation 偏倚)。
*   注: DCEP never-treated 非 sandbox 的 ~2/87 稀疏情形 (iv_did.py:779 的 2/87 是 sandbox);
*   notyet 在 DCEP 下仍是稳健默认 (效率 + 无预期), 非因 never-treated 稀缺被迫选择。
* ============================================================================
qui levelsof year, local(_yrs)
local _n_years : word count `_yrs'
capture which csdid
local _has_csdid = (_rc == 0)
capture confirm variable dcep_treat_year
local _has_gvar = (_rc == 0)
if (`_n_years' >= 3) & `_has_csdid' & `_has_gvar' {
    qui count if dcep_treat_year > 0 & dcep_treat_year < .
    if r(N) > 0 {
        display "  [M7 csdid] DCEP-policy 错时 DiD 辅助: gvar=dcep_treat_year, notyet (注意力不进协变量)"
        capture noisily csdid {{MAIN_DV}} $controls, ///
            ivar(bank_id) time(year) gvar(dcep_treat_year) notyet
        if !_rc {
            capture noisily estat event
            capture noisily estat pretrend
            display "[OK] M7 csdid staggered DiD + event-study 完成"
        }
        else {
            display "  [INFO] csdid 估计失败; 见上方 noisily 输出"
        }
    }
    else {
        display "  [INFO] dcep_treat_year 无处理组; M7 csdid 跳过"
    }
}
else {
    display "  [INFO] M7 csdid 跳过 — need T>=3 (got `_n_years'), csdid installed (`_has_csdid'), dcep_treat_year (`_has_gvar'); T=2 盘面退化纯 TWFE, T>=3 生产面板自动激活"
}
